# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Contact & Booking forms (Web3Forms — no account servers needed)
#
# 1. Go to https://web3forms.com, enter the email where you want to
#    receive messages, and copy the "Access Key" it gives you.
# 2. Either paste that key into src/lib/web3forms.ts, OR set it here.
#
# This key is safe to be public — it only lets visitors send YOU email.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
